## Headers on map144's own Python files

**Verified in this repository.** Python files whose first 30 lines contain
a copyright notice name Jeff Millar, WA1HCO. After `FlexQMAP2.py` was
removed, every such header grants GPL-3.0-or-later, written as the FSF
"any later version" boilerplate (92 files), `SPDX-License-Identifier:
GPL-3.0-or-later` (24 files), or a "Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later" line
(32 files). Those headers were not edited.

The repository [LICENSE](LICENSE) is GPL-3.0, the version-3 text, with no
project-level "or any later version" grant. Whether the per-file grants
should stay "or later" is unresolved. That question is sharper for a file
that is also a WSJT-X port (`sq_det.py`), because the WSJT-X README and
About dialog checked above name version 3 and do not say "or any later
version".
